WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.054
The British didn't win every

2
00:00:02.054 --> 00:00:03.252
state by war.

3
00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:04.967
Some they took by treaty,

4
00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:07.253
others by inheritance rules.

5
00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:10.288
Under Lord Wellesley's subsidiary alliance,

6
00:00:10.288 --> 00:00:11.870
a ruler paid for British

7
00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.954
troops. He couldn't make other

8
00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:16.031
alliances, and accepted a British

9
00:00:16.031 --> 00:00:19.032
Resident. Hyderabad signed first.

10
00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:20.742
Under Lord Dalhousie,

11
00:00:20.742 --> 00:00:22.308
a state without a natural

12
00:00:22.308 --> 00:00:24.268
heir lapsed to the Company.

13
00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:26.357
Satara, Jhansi and Nagpur were

14
00:00:26.357 --> 00:00:28.040
annexed this way.

15
00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:30.411
Tipu Sultan refused.

16
00:00:30.411 --> 00:00:34.486
He was killed defending Seringapatam

17
00:00:34.486 --> 00:00:35.969
in 1799.

18
00:00:36.314 --> 00:00:37.491
Your turn.

19
00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:39.824
Who's associated with it?
